  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **William Tell Bridge**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Milestones**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2021-10-15.CynthiaWoodsMitchellPavillionWoodlandsTX** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 170 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended, driving up the same day with their brother, and saw Weir, Billy and Mayer's band live for the first time [2]\n- Lineup listed: Bob Weir on guitar and vocals, John Mayer on guitar and vocals, Oteil Burbridge on bass and vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2021-10-15.CynthiaWoodsMitchellPavillionWoodlandsTX**: taped by W. Zimmerman; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Sennheiser Me-80 Mini Shotguns> GakCables > Mix Pre 6 @ 16/48 [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Sennheiser ME-80 mini shotgun microphones, GakCables, and a Mix Pre 6 recorder at 16-bit/48kHz; Transfer: SD card files tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 13, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
